.DS_Store
node_modules/
dist/

# Build artifacts — regenerated from Supabase KV on every `npm run dev` /
# `npm run build` by scripts/generate-icons-{json,files}.mjs. Supabase is
# canonical for icons. See .claude/cms-architecture.md §"Icon pipeline".
/public/icons/
/public/icons.json
/public/icons.index.json

# Build artifacts — regenerated on every `npm run dev` / `npm run build`
# by scripts/generate-llms-txt.mjs. bootstrap.css alternates between a
# 12-line shim (prod) and a full inline copy (dev), so the file dirties
# every time the dev/prod modes alternate. Treat all three as generated
# only — edit the template inside generate-llms-txt.mjs instead.
/public/llms.txt
/public/tokens/bootstrap.css
/public/tokens/breakpoints.js
